  "description": "Suntae, a third-year aspiring police officer. His name is not on the list of successful candidates. He ran out of his studio apartment hiding the news of his rejection from his girlfriend Nayeon, who had been supporting him, and someone is watching Nayeon, who is left alone. Suntae discovers a person presumed to be a stalker and continues to chase after them, but the moment he sees his face...!\n\n\n**Official Webtoon:**  \n[Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/signs_of_rain), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=6846267), [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/4419003926)",
